{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally Gets a Job at a Magazine"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Celebratory Dinner"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le16ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Expressing Opinions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use these expressions to introduce your opinion:"}, {"type": "text", "content": " <span class=\"italic\">(Personally,) I think \u2026</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">In my opinion \u2026</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">I would like to point out \u2026 </span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">The way I see it \u2026</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">I'd say that \u2026 </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I think we should go for seafood tonight. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "The way I see it, this is a celebratory dinner!"}, {"type": "example", "content": " In my opinion, sushi is much better! "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making and Responding to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you make and respond to requests, remember to be polite."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Look at the chart below. Practice the requests and responses below."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Making a Request\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Responding to a Request\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Would you mind \u2026?</span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Would you like \u2026?</span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could I get \u2026? </span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I get \u2026? </span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I would like ... </span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I was wondering if \u2026</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure.</span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">No problem.</span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Certainly. </span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Of course. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Mia</span>: I was wondering if I could get some salt, please.<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Of course.<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Mia</span>: Thank you. Could I get some sugar as well?<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: No problem. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lemonade"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a drink made from lemons, sugar, and water "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would like a glass of lemonade, please."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about food and drinks in a restaurant."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "water"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a clear liquid without a color, smell, or taste "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Water is fine for me, thanks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "appetizer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small dish that you eat at the beginning of a meal "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Could I get some appetizers?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "French onion soup"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an onion and beef stock based soup served with croutons and cheese on top "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can I get the French onion soup please?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "quinoa"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small grain from a plant grown in the Andes "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can try our new quinoa salad with vegetables."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lettuce wrap"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a type of sandwich made with a leaf of lettuce which is rolled around meat or vegetables  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A lettuce wrap sounds like a delicious idea."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le16ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Visit a local restaurant in your neighborhood."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to the people around you talk. How did they make requests? How do the waiters respond to their requests?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Pretend you are a waiter at this restaurant."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue about you and a customer in English."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give them your opinion about what they should try."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your dialogue aloud with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I visit a local restaurant. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about about different dishes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make and respond to requests in a restaurant. "}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "t